FTACC='Fort Leavenworth is an active Army post. A visitor without a Department of Defense ID card stops first at the Visitor Center at Metropolitan Avenue and 4th Street; every vehicle needs current tags, proof of insurance and registration and can be searched on the way in (Army leaflet). Look from the public streets of the post.'
